\n\n  Line 25: ## 2. INSTALL A SKILLED CHECKOUT\n\n  Line 27: ### Prerequisites\n\n  Line 31: ### Clone and Build\n\n  Line 55: ### Check the Install\n\n  Line 71: ### Meaning Matching for Commands\n\n  Line 96: ### Add Code Mode\n\n  Line 108: ### Git Hooks\n\n  Line 116: ## 3. LINK IT INTO YOUR PROJECT\n\n  Line 118: ### Step 1: Run the Install Guide\n\n  Line 139: ### Step 2: Run the Printed Steps\n\n  Line 152: ### Step 3: Check the Links\n\n  Line 160: ### What Gets Linked\n\n  Line 177: ### Keep the Links Out of Git\n\n  Line 183: ### Undo a Link\n\n  Line 197: ## 4. COPY IT INTO YOUR PROJECT\n\n  Line 208: ### Step 1: Create the Copy\n\n  Line 219: ### Step 2: Create the Overlay Folder\n\n  Line 254: ### Overlay Types\n\n  Line 267: ### Step 3: Apply the Overlays\n\n  Line 285: ### Change an Overlay\n\n  Line 297: ### Step 4: Re-Pin to a Newer Commit\n\n  Line 314: ### Undo a Re-Pin\n\n  Line 324: ### Bring an Existing Overlay Folder\n\n  Line 330: ## 5. KEEP IT HEALTHY\n\n  Line 341: ## 6. TROUBLESHOOTING\n\n  Line 358: ## 7. RELATED DOCUMENTS\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"^### Check the Install|^## |^### \",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794539486784,"end":1794539487289}}}}
